# Vercel CLI uses this instead of .gitignore when deciding what to upload.
# The root .gitignore excludes "node_modules/" unanchored, which would also
# match dist/assets/node_modules/... (Expo's font/icon asset output) and
# cause those files to 404 on the deployed site. Deploys only ever upload
# the already-built ./dist folder, so nothing needs to be excluded here.
